! This test calculates the electric dipole polarizability of He, Be, Ne, and Ar
! using the GRAC and SAOP asymptotic correction schemes.
! The chosen functionals are GRAC: PBE0gracLB94
!                        and SAOP: GLLBsaopLBalpha
!
! Please note that the basis-sets are far from being appropriate, just for demonstration.
!
! We assume that the correlation consistent basis sets are available in your standard path. These sets can be
! obtained from the DALTON distribution and may later be included in the DIRAC distribution as well.
